ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/94/pshsg8wxqv3qp46ul6h9i35vtdxsqhz.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%BD%92%E4%B9%A1%E5%8F%B7%E8%A7%92.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/94/pshsg8wxqv3qp46ul6h9i35vtdxsqhz.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />归乡号角\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（光环）使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内所有己方，暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>；若目标拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"解放\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">解放</font></span></span>]，暴击率额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，暴击伤害额外提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。<br />✦自身拥有额外效果：被受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"受治疗逆转\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">受治疗逆转</font></span></span>]类效果的敌人攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B5%AB%E7%A0%82\" title=\"角色图鉴库/赫砂\"><img alt=\"头像 赫砂.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b2/g4conc6pmbuz5qd71or93lj2adce8ab.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">赫砂</font></div>\n</div>\n</d